#
# NixOS adaptation: implement the TOD driver's enrolment path so GNOME's
# standard "Add fingerprint" flow works without a second prompt.  The trustlet
# still authorises enrolment with the account credential input, but that input
# is prepared by pam_liuqin_fpc at password authentication (root keyring, one
# use) and consumed here through user_credentials.py --enrol-prepared; the
# driver only drives the touches, translates the trustlet's progress lines into
# libfprint progress/retry signals and hands the opaque single-finger database
# to fprintd as the enrolled FpPrint.  The CLI acceptance flow stays available
# and shares the same custody.
#
